<%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  
  <%- include('../partials/header')%>
  <main class="page">
    <% if (userRole === 'admin') { %>
    <section class="role-card">
      <a class="role-btn role-btn--admin" href="/admin/home">Admin</a>
    </section>
    <% } else if (userRole === 'citizen') { %>
    <section class="role-card">
      <a class="role-btn role-btn--citizen" href="/user/home">Citizen</a>
    </section>
    <% } %>
    <section class="info-cards">
      <div class="info-card info-card--move-x" data-dir="ltr">
        <h2>For Better City</h2>
        <p>
          Citizens can use the app to actively participate in building a better city by reporting issues such as potholes,
          broken streetlights, or illegal dumping with ease. The app allows users to attach photos and specify the exact
          location, ensuring efficient municipal response. Residents receive real-time updates on the progress of their
          reports and resolution status.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card info-card--move-x" data-dir="rtl">
        <h2>For Better Governance</h2>
        <p>
          The platform enables municipal authorities to manage civic complaints through a centralized digital dashboard.
          Automated prioritization based on issue frequency and severity helps officials allocate resources effectively,
          reduce response time, and ensure transparency in governance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card info-card--move-x" data-dir="ltr">
        <h2>For Better Citizen Engagement</h2>
        <p>
          By providing a simple and transparent reporting mechanism, the app encourages active citizen participation.
          Verified user reports, status notifications, and feedback mechanisms build trust between residents and authorities,
          fostering a sense of shared responsibility in urban development.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/auth.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>